<#f0f000>:Normal Attacks:</>
Light Punch (A)									^X
Light Kick  (B)									^A
Heavy Punch (C)									^Y
Heavy Kick  (D)									^B
Crouch Light Punch (A)							_D_+^X
Crouch Light Kick  (B)							_D_+^A
Crouch Heavy Punch (C)							_D_+^Y
Crouch Heavy Kick  (D)							_D_+^B
Jump Light Punch  (A)							_U_+^X
Jump Light Kick   (B)							_U_+^A
Jump Heavy Punch  (C)							_U_+^Y
Jump Heavy Kick   (D)							_U_+^B
Taunt											^S


<#f0f000>:Throws:</>
Forward Throw									_F_+^Y
Forward Throw									_F_+^B
Back Throw										_B_+^Y
Back Throw										_B_+^B


<#f0f000>:Special Moves:</>
Dash Straight (突进直拳)						_D_, _DF_, _F_, ^X
Rising Kick  (升龙踢 · 对空)					_D_, _DB_, _B_, ^X
EX Dash Straight (500 Power)					_D_, _DF_, _F_, ^Y


<#f0f000>:Super Moves:</>
Super Dash Straight (1000 Power)				_D_, _DF_, _F_, _D_, _DF_, _F_, ^X


<#f0f000>:Cancels:</>
Light normal -> Heavy normal -> Special -> EX / Super
(i.e. A/B -> C/D -> 236+A or 214+A -> 236+C or 236236+A)
